>> title: Thunder pepper skillet
>> servings: 2
>> tags: supper, one pan

Heat a #cast iron skillet{} until it just starts to smoke.

Sear @chicken thighs{2-3}(skin on) for ~sear{4%minutes} a side, then set aside.

Soften @onion{½}(sliced) and @bell peppers{1½%cups}(sliced) in the fat, add @garlic{3%cloves}(crushed) and @chilli flakes{¾%tsp}.

Return the chicken, pour in @stock{200%ml} and let it bubble for ~{8 to 10%minutes}.
